      "filename": "Door (2363993521).jpg",
      "title": "File:Door (2363993521).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/40/Door_%282363993521%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Door_(2363993521).jpg",
      "width": 2732,
      "height": 2520,
